1
00:00:00,622 --> 00:00:03,002
(Leonard:)-Where's Penny?
-She returned to her apartment.

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:05,126
(Sheldon:)I presume to shower and vomit.

3
00:00:05,293 --> 00:00:07,923
(Sheldon:)Not necessarily in that order.

4
00:00:08,296 --> 00:00:10,086
(Leonard:)Wonder why she didn't say goodbye.

5
00:00:10,923 --> 00:00:14,763
(Sheldon:)Are you expecting me to offer
an explanation of human behavior?

6
00:00:14,927 --> 00:00:16,557
I know. I thought as an outsider...

7
00:00:16,721 --> 00:00:19,181
(Leonard:)...you might be able to provide
a fresh perspective.

8
00:00:23,436 --> 00:00:27,106
Well, I have no difficulty
believing you are not butter.

9
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:31,990
(Leonard:)-Oh, hey.
-Oh, hi.

10
00:00:32,153 --> 00:00:35,783
(Penny:)-I gotta run. Early shift.
-Okay, I'll walk down with you.

11
00:00:35,948 --> 00:00:37,908
(Leonard:)So last night was fun, huh?

12
00:00:38,076 --> 00:00:41,746
PENNY: Yeah, it must've been.
I just threw up in my closet.

13
00:00:42,455 --> 00:00:43,495
LEONARD:
Bummer.

14
00:00:43,665 --> 00:00:46,085
(Leonard:)I was thinking tonight
maybe we could catch a movie.

15
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,340
(Penny:)Oh, yeah, tonight's not great for me.

16
00:00:48,503 --> 00:00:52,293
(Leonard:)Doesn't have to be tonight.
I'm free pretty much always.

17
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:55,129
(Penny:)Leonard, last night was a mistake.

18
00:00:55,593 --> 00:00:58,263
When you say "mistake,"
do you mean a fortunate mistake...

19
00:00:58,429 --> 00:01:01,139
(Leonard:)...like the discovery of penicillin?

